<p><span style="float: right"><img alt="API logo" src="arXiv_api_xml.png" /></span></p>
<h1 id="arxiv-api-users-manual">arXiv API User's Manual</h1>
<p>Please review the <a href="tou.html">Terms of Use for arXiv APIs</a> before using the arXiv
API.</p>
<h3 id="table-of-contents">Table of Contents</h3>
<p><a href="#_preface">1. Preface</a><br />
